    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviewCount": 3100,
    "pros": [
      "8,500 RPM brushless motor accepts 4-1/2\" or 5\" wheels",
      "Automatic speed change adjusts speed and torque under load",
      "Strong, consistent performance on LXT batteries",
      "Around 3,100 Amazon ratings averaging 4.7",
      "Long-running model with a large base of owner feedback"
